WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.038
How you dey!

00:00:01.038 --> 00:00:03.545
Welcome to Scitylana Academy.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:11.760
Today, we go talk about data — wetin e be, and how you go take start to dey write your records.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.568
Data no be big grammar.

00:00:14.568 --> 00:00:18.142
Every time you sell something, na data.

00:00:18.142 --> 00:00:21.350
Every money wey you spend, na data.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.108
Every customer wey buy from you, na data.

00:00:25.808 --> 00:00:30.321
You fit write am for notebook, for your phone, or for Excel.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:36.488
Any one wey you choose, di important thing na say make you dey write am every day.

00:00:37.188 --> 00:00:38.719
See am like dis.

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:43.119
Date, wetin you sell, how many, and di amount.

00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:50.868
Your expense too — like di money for fuel or oil — write am, put minus for front.

00:00:51.568 --> 00:00:56.750
When you don write for two or three weeks, you go begin see pattern.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:01.626
You go know which day market dey move, and which day e dey slow.

00:01:01.626 --> 00:01:03.760
Na dis one go help you plan.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.092
Your homework: start your record today.

00:01:08.092 --> 00:01:12.376
For di next lesson, we go put am inside Excel.

00:01:12.376 --> 00:01:15.356
Thank you, see you for Module 2!
